  lectureTitle: Building System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fed450ba160e784e9b0b3c2ff69b0b2, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Building System where you can place down building Blueprints,
    add resources and start constructing. Upon finishing the final building is spawned
    and may or may not have extra logic.


    In this Scenario, the Player can pick
    up resources, then place down either a House or a FirePit, construct the buildings,
    and then in the case of the Fire Pit the player can interact with it to add fuel
    to the fire.'
